d9e392cf-61fd-4d98-9648-ab5dad3389bf/10355-0
02:06:48.879 --> 02:06:51.976
So once a warp goes through various
states,

d9e392cf-61fd-4d98-9648-ab5dad3389bf/10355-1
02:06:51.976 --> 02:06:56.833
once a warp is launched and it becomes
